{
  "src_audio": "唐荣兴一锤一火锻匠心 炉火不熄守艺人.wav",
  "duration": 229.556,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.994,
      "end": 5.16,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "现在啊，传统打铁技艺可以说是好难得看到到了。",
      "score": 0.1834,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3281,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.221,
        "seg_cer": 0.15,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "现在啊，传统打铁技艺可以讲是好难得看得到。",
        "dur": 4.166,
        "n_char": 20,
        "text_check": "建议校对"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.948,
      "end": 11.259,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "重庆偏铺街巷的打铁铺也是渐渐地淡出了人们的视野。",
      "score": 0.1234,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1541,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.046,
        "seg_cer": 0.217,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "从前偏不改行的打铁铺，也是渐渐地淡出了人们的视野。",
        "dur": 5.311,
        "n_char": 23,
        "text_check": "留意"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 11.478,
      "end": 15.154,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这一门手艺只能偶尔在影视剧里头看到了。",
      "score": 0.0508,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0024,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.111,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "这一门手艺只能够是在影视剧里头看到了。",
        "dur": 3.676,
        "n_char": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 15.423,
      "end": 19.221,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "但是啊，在新安县祥利镇渡头江边，",
      "score": 0.2786,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3253,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.218,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "新/兴",
        "text_free": "但是啊，在兴安县祥利镇都头江边。",
        "dur": 3.798,
        "n_char": 14,
        "text_check": "建议校对"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 19.221,
      "end": 23.826,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "五十六岁的铁匠唐永兴用四十盏光影与汗水，",
      "score": 0.1878,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1841,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.076,
        "seg_cer": 0.105,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "影/阴",
        "text_free": "五十六岁的铁匠唐永兴，用四十载光阴与汗水。",
        "dur": 4.605,
        "n_char": 19,
        "text_check": "留意"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 23.826,
      "end": 26.694,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "执着守护着这一门古老的手艺。",
      "score": 0.218,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1233,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.015,
        "seg_cer": 0.385,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.2,
        "phon_examples": "护/扶",
        "text_free": "制作手扶桌这一门古老的手艺。",
        "dur": 2.868,
        "n_char": 13,
        "text_check": "留意"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 26.974,
      "end": 30.452,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "杨青村的打铁生在强谈严肃。",
      "score": 0.671,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.0877,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.983,
        "seg_cer": 0.417,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "杨清车的打铁声在江畔严肃。",
        "dur": 3.478,
        "n_char": 12,
        "text_check": "建议校对"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 31.033,
      "end": 35.36,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "渡头江边一间未挂招牌的铁匠铺静静伫立。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0149,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "渡头江边，一间未挂招牌的铁匠铺静静伫立。",
        "dur": 4.327,
        "n_char": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 35.675,
      "end": 41.677,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "刚靠近铺子，桌椅的铁器温度就裹挟着叮叮当当的打铁声扑面而来。",
      "score": 0.1327,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0021,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.071,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "桌/作",
        "text_free": "刚靠近铺子，作业的铁器温度就裹挟着叮叮当当的打铁声扑面而来。",
        "dur": 6.002,
        "n_char": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 41.946,
      "end": 45.578,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "瞬间将人拉回传统手艺的血火场景当中。",
      "score": 0.2017,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0836,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.353,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.167,
        "phon_examples": "瞬/孙",
        "text_free": "孙亮将迎拉斐传统手艺的玄货场景当中。",
        "dur": 3.632,
        "n_char": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 46.006,
      "end": 49.399,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "铺内炉火正旺，唐永兴左手拿着铁锤，",
      "score": 0.337,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2703,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.163,
        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.4,
        "phon_examples": "兴/新 内/雷",
        "text_free": "普雷炉火正旺，唐永新左手拿到铁钳。",
        "dur": 3.393,
        "n_char": 15,
        "text_check": "留意"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 49.595,
      "end": 52.051,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "稳稳地夹到烧得通红的铁块，",
      "score": 0.2149,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0928,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.25,
        "phon_examples": "烧/扫",
        "text_free": "猛猛地夹刀，扫得通红的铁块。",
        "dur": 2.456,
        "n_char": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 52.111,
      "end": 56.663,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "按到铁砧上，右手抡起铁锤反复锻打，",
      "score": 0.0305,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0089,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.067,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "按到铁枕上，右手抡起铁锤，反复锻打。",
        "dur": 4.552,
        "n_char": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 56.663,
      "end": 62.819,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "火星随着锤落溅起，在空气当中发出转瞬即逝的光亮。",
      "score": 0.0416,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0034,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.091,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "火星垂着坠落，溅起在空气当中，发出转瞬即逝的光亮。",
        "dur": 6.156,
        "n_char": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 63.169,
      "end": 67.706,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "原本生硬的铁块在他数十年练就的技艺当中，",
      "score": 0.283,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2939,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.186,
        "seg_cer": 0.316,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.167,
        "phon_examples": "生/深",
        "text_free": "原本深谙的铁块，在他数十年研究的记忆当中。",
        "dur": 4.537,
        "n_char": 19,
        "text_check": "留意"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 67.817,
      "end": 72.576,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "渐渐地褪去冷光，慢慢地显露出了清晰图形。",
      "score": 0.2904,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4701,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.363,
        "seg_cer": 0.222,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "渐渐地褪去轮廓，慢慢地显露出咾清晰雏形。",
        "dur": 4.759,
        "n_char": 18,
        "text_check": "建议校对"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 72.763,
      "end": 79.553,
      "label": "uncertain",
      "text": "据悉，唐永兴屋里的打铁人生从爷爷那一辈起就在铺头撑开起，",
      "score": 0.4896,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.7004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.594,
        "seg_cer": 0.308,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "lexicon": "屋里",
        "text_free": "据悉，唐永新无厘头的打铁营生，从爷爷那一辈起，就在普头村开启。",
        "dur": 6.79,
        "n_char": 26,
        "text_check": "建议校对"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 79.664,
      "end": 82.969,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "靠着一锤一火延续着古老技艺。",
      "score": 0.0703,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.003,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.154,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "靠着一锤一火，延续着古老记忆。",
        "dur": 3.305,
        "n_char": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 82.969,
      "end": 86.686,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "后来父亲将铁铺迁到如今的渡江桥头，",
      "score": 0.1214,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2312,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.124,
        "seg_cer": 0.125,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "后来，父亲将铁铺迁到 Eugene 的渡江桥头。",
        "dur": 3.717,
        "n_char": 16,
        "text_check": "留意"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 86.992,
      "end": 90.265,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "五十六岁的唐永兴也接过了打铁的锤子，",
      "score": 0.0269,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.066,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.059,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "十六岁的唐永兴也接过了打铁的锤子。",
        "dur": 3.273,
        "n_char": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 90.442,
      "end": 94.067,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "开启了自己长达四十年的打铁生涯。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "开启了自己长达四十年的打铁生涯。",
        "dur": 3.625,
        "n_char": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 94.103,
      "end": 96.536,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "因为从小是在家里面打铁的，",
      "score": 0.1907,
      "signals": {
